ow-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q06688","text":"Galaxy PLA is a deep metallic colored PLA type of 3D printer filament with a high contend of silver aluminum particles inside, which gives 3D printed parts a sparkling galaxy-like effect.","source":"R-FORMFUTURA-READER-20261004-036785dac2f2","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q06689","text":"Galaxy PLA is a deep metallic coloured PLA filament.","source":"R-FORMFUTURA-READER-20261004-036785dac2f2","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q06690","text":"This results in a beautiful sparkling, reflecting and glittering finish to a printed object.","source":"R-FORMFUTURA-READER-20261004-036785dac2f2","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q06691","text":"Printed objects have subtle colour shadings and radiance and no visible layers.","source":"R-FORMFUTURA-READER-20261004-036785dac2f2","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q06693","text":"Extremely glittering & shimmering surface finish","source":"R-FORMFUTURA-READER-20261004-036785dac2f2","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q06694","text":"3D print objects without visible layers","source":"R-FORMFUTURA-READER-20261004-036785dac2f2","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q06696","text":"Incredibly deep coloured 3D printer filament","source":"R-FORMFUTURA-READER-20261004-036785dac2f2","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Adhesion between layers","items":[{"id":"Q06699","text":"Improved flowing behaviour and inter-layer adhesion","source":"R-FORMFUTURA-READER-20261004-036785dac2f2","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Nozzle wear","items":[{"id":"Q01551","text":"Even though its high silver-aluminium-flaked content Gal